WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.948
Ready to publish lists anything that stops the course going for review, in plain words.

00:00:05.898 --> 00:00:08.567
Choose a line to go straight to it.

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:11.940
Suggestions below help make the course better.

00:00:12.902 --> 00:00:16.628
Reviewers comment on exactly what learners will see.

00:00:16.578 --> 00:00:20.249
In the preview, choose Comment on any block.

00:00:20.249 --> 00:00:24.429
Authors reply, fix it, and resolve the thread.

00:00:25.394 --> 00:00:32.310
When others open the same course, you see who is here, and you are warned before two people change the same lesson.

00:00:33.236 --> 00:00:36.870
When everything is ready, choose Send for review.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:41.351
A reviewer reads it, asks for changes or publishes it.

00:00:41.351 --> 00:00:46.964
Learners already enrolled keep the version they started; new learners get the new one.
